# 20240911 next-sitemap
public/sitemap*.xml
public/robots.txt
#
# 2026-03-27 to 2026-08-17 these were tracked in git instead of generated, because
# the Vercel adapter in Next.js 16.2 stopped serving files written to public/ after
# next build (https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/91864). Fixed in vercel CLI
# 50.38.0, so postbuild generation owns them again. Do not pin VERCEL_CLI_VERSION
# below that version.

